All Business Models — Ranked

I've ranked every model from your list. Ranking logic: structural demand → barrier to entry → path to first R10k/month → defensibility → solo-founder fit in SA.

---

Tier 1 — Start here (real demand, real moat, realistic solo path)

# Business Why
1 Electrical CoC (Voltguard) Legally mandated on every property transfer. Deadline-pressured buyer. Registration is both barrier and moat.
2 Solar/inverter maintenance contracts Recurring revenue on an installed base already paid for. Low capital. Same partner leverages it.
3 Estate CCTV / access control maintenance Estates are recurring, contract-driven, pay on time. Physical moat — you're already on site.
4 Essential repair and maintenance Universal, non-discretionary. Low capital. Recurring if you build maintenance contracts.
5 Electrical and property maintenance coordination Layered on top of #1 and #4. Same client base, higher revenue per relationship.

